      "summary": "Solid and concise, with 5+5 findings and 8 moves, each with acceptance criteria. It preserves the brand and workflows and gives explicit next-hour triage. The craft guidance is less precise on radius and elevation. Running the validation task with two analysts makes the plan less minimal than requested. Overall it is sound but somewhat less specific than A and C."
