      "score": 91,
      "summary": "Very thorough. Each move is traced back to a finding ID, and the craft guidance is the most specific of the three: 14px/1.4 text, an 8/16/24 spacing scale, 4–8px radii, shadows only on overlays, and tabular numerals. Overdue items are kept separate from next-hour items. The evidence labeling is careful and the validation plan is decisive. It is long and close to the line budget, and treating the chart/insights finding as blocking is debatable."
